+	// AOT-safe replacement for the DynamicMethod-based deep cloning (excluded from compilation by the csproj).
+	// Runtimes without a JIT cannot execute Reflection.Emit or instantiate generic helpers over types only known at
+	// run time, so the per-type clone delegates walk the same cached field list with FieldInfo.GetValue/SetValue.
